- If any of your $1,350 “unreimbursed expenses” are actually employee unreimbursed expenses (i.e., for a W‑2 job), note that miscellaneous unreimbursed employee expenses are not deductible for 2018–2025 (TCJA suspension) — only self‑employment business expenses on Schedule C are deductible.

